<title>USA: First Albany says Ohio highway bond bids rejected.</title>
<headline>First Albany says Ohio highway bond bids rejected.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Corp said its bids for a $100 million Ohio highway bond issue and a $50 million Ohio highway bond issue were rejected.</p>
<p>A new winner has not yet been selected yet. The state is expected to announce a winner after 1300 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
